# The Kubernetes daemons (containerd, kubelet) and the QEMU guest agent, out
# of system.slice: Slice=kube.slice in their units' drop-ins. Pods aren't
# here: the kubelet puts them in kubepods.slice, next to this one.
# No resource limits: the kubelet's kubeReserved/systemReserved caps
# kubepods.slice instead. See systemd.slice(5) and
# https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/administer-cluster/reserve-compute-resources/
[Unit]
Description=Kubernetes daemons (containerd, kubelet)
Documentation=man:systemd.slice(5)
